{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0af1479c03f30ee52b89e20ee4a544d37d87e64846da3220218fcb0dc85404d8", "ja": "（今日は春香の新PV撮影の日だ）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄春香的新PV。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "a0c72111079d8b1153354aa864fc4e96588394a978c91971f604d4fb5dfbe80e", "ja": "メェ～メェ～。\nさあ、羊さん、こっちだメェ～！", "zh": "咩～咩～\n来，绵羊，在这边咩～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1002_p", "source_sha256": "132e8dd30a6ef65083a092cdc2b366d475be0a8573bd227a8622ffeca25e526f", "ja": "……春香、何やってるんだ？", "zh": "……春香，你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "c3f5f8ff8108011949973d8a1058aa7f4a523db3b4c1f1a7ccf25a8306d881a6", "ja": "あっ、お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\n今のは、これから撮影するPVの練習で……えへへ。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n我在练习等会要拍的PV……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1004_p", "source_sha256": "836d7f2c33940689f1f6d41a96880e1daeebe9e799f23e1e87879be5f13da055", "ja": "ああ、なるほど。羊飼いの役だったっけ。\nその衣装も似合ってるし、ぴったりだな。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样，你是演牧羊人对吧。\n那套服装你穿起来很好看，非常适合你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "abd182f4b93e3d935f0ae7cdb7e2c77f0213686edd01b89043a5a48c09bc20ac", "ja": "ありがとうございます。この衣装、ふわふわで\nかわいくて、私も気に入ってるんです♪", "zh": "谢谢你。这套服装软绵绵的，很可爱，\n我自己也非常喜欢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f70c87085c06e259b523750b5a6c7f1b71c899f8d62874ef96144aa8798d83d6", "ja": "それはよかった。それなら、このあとの\n撮影も期待できそうだな。", "zh": "那真是太好了。\n这样看来，可以期待待会的拍摄了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "9c2c4a6cc52cdacc61e653e951261970ebf711ed2a3c6262f94f5538bda47512", "ja": "それが……、ちょっと迷ってるんです。\n羊飼いの演技、今の感じでいいのかなって。", "zh": "这个嘛……其实我不是很确定，\n用刚才那种感觉去演牧羊人到底合不合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "5f7bbb2723c78ab367d480480e9673368e6fce845777c8440ed771bdf43d1f3d", "ja": "どこかに、お手本があればいいんですけど、羊飼い。\nうーん……。", "zh": "要是有牧羊人可以让我当参考就好了。\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1009_p", "source_sha256": "994f2966ce23975f574284252ca79f55b67c72ee7177ad14b9bca342ac85fd54", "ja": "まあ、あんまり身近にはいないもんな、羊飼い。\nうーん……。", "zh": "这样啊，牧羊人确实很少见呢。\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "0e7a743c16d3365c5dad8a0dd38e76e65d7b4ff17f398600413d6d2d15e56e79", "ja": "そうなんですよ。たくさんの羊をリードして、\n羊たちから慕われて、信頼されて、頼もしくて。", "zh": "对啊，牧羊人会带领羊群，\n受到羊儿们仰慕和信任，而且很可靠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "bca4c3f09d7057b94ac2536dc3bb5f8297f9ea849d60f9d5774489d8975d61e4", "ja": "そんな感じの人が、どこかに……。\n……あっ！", "zh": "这样的人，到底哪里会有……\n……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "dab57deec9feebeb71635bacc80145debc32bf14d4d63812cb39208c74f19105", "ja": "{$P$}さん！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1013_p", "source_sha256": "10accce543cd925e240251644db1a58e8ec2da93890774da80ca3bf8f91c7757", "ja": "ん？　なんだ、何か思いついたのか？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？你想到什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "422dfd50541c046e45032b9eb0cb629894d2b81ca8e29749cf350f3f2af25ec0", "ja": "{$P$}さんですよ！\n{$P$}さんが、羊飼いです！", "zh": "就是{$P$}先生啊！\n{$P$}先生就是牧羊人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "056d723b3bb55de8798ee6c0f16f21c7992cc45bc5444c8f260945da6db5e09d", "ja": "たくさんの羊をリードする代わりに、たくさんの\nアイドルをプロデュースして……そっくりです！", "zh": "你带领的虽然不是羊群，但你培育了\n许许多多的偶像……就跟牧羊人一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0f183430c6dd2d34a933627bbaef301ac6499f6cabfcebf90e263e11e4650833", "ja": "ん？　そ、そう言われてみれば、そうかな？", "zh": "嗯？经、经你这么一说，似乎有点像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "ce55ec9e1a481f9e175a5a6a245f53b5ad9eec6ae6092b191aee316d076f2b36", "ja": "よーし。さっそく、{$P$}さんを\nじっくり観察させてもらいますね！　…………。", "zh": "好～我马上就来仔细观察{$P$}先生！\n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "4ab7fa1863940dd910051fc6d4423e4ee0e54ac058ff9d43db299e6360307192", "ja": "じー…………。", "zh": "（盯）…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3c4d2c5fd365b08b392567dd5789b1e406ca975b0d62bb4f9eb74ed06f6f4272", "ja": "いや、急に観察されても困るというか……。\nうーん、落ち着かないなぁ。", "zh": "呃，突然开始被你观察是该说困扰还是……\n嗯……感觉真不自在啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "052d2b3abb6dd138c8052acbb93085bbab1a3b37122ff2d2f77b246859ea8905", "ja": "ぷふっ！　……あ、すみません！\nあんまり緊張してるから、つい～。", "zh": "噗呵！啊……对不起！\n看你这么紧张，不小心就～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "0a14d8ebfbb67a76567ff34fd3836e96a05bf14802e03f2e60f16ded0f76c970", "ja": "それに考えてみたら、{$P$}さんの\nことは、いつも見てますし。今さらでしたね♪", "zh": "而且仔细想想，我一直都有在关注\n{$P$}先生，也不用再特地观察呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "bea68e729da7cf51ef6d35e84f3b70fb8bf6d2aa8fc724cff077e5cba6b4ecf3", "ja": "えへへ、いつもありがとうございますっ。\nおかげさまで、羊飼い役もがんばれそうです♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你总是当我的榜样！\n托你的福，我好像能演好牧羊人这个角色了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1024_p", "source_sha256": "a27a189f26f8a528c3f6d820451f98757232eb2347d970fefed958c524095760", "ja": "あ、ああ。役に立てたならよかったよ。\n期待してるからな！", "zh": "这、这样啊，有帮上忙就好。\n我很期待你的表现喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0114_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "7bad61a906da6492eafded788fcd747ce02ad0e0969b905f322afc2ed8440c58", "ja": "はーい！　やっぱり{$P$}さんは、\n羊を元気にするのが上手だなぁ……。ふふっ♪", "zh": "好～！{$P$}先生\n果然很会让绵羊打起精神呢……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
